Error: Jet.EveryFieldTargetInvalid: `#EveryField(of: Status)` requires a struct type
  --> Tests/UI/every_field_non_struct.jet:7:1
    |
  7 | #EveryField(of: Status)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Status` is not a struct — `#EveryField` only checks stored fields of a struct
 Fix: Use a struct type with `#EveryField(of: ...)`, or exhaustive `if == { … }` matching for enums
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.EveryFieldTargetInvalid

Error: Jet.EveryFieldTargetInvalid: `#EveryField(of: Int)` requires a struct type
  --> Tests/UI/every_field_non_struct.jet:12:1
    |
 12 | #EveryField(of: Int)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Int` is not a struct type, so it has no stored struct fields to check
 Fix: Name a struct type in `#EveryField(of: ...)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.EveryFieldTargetInvalid
